LOADHEX  R0 FB   !Load register 0 with value FB
PRINT    R0      !Print contents of register 0
LOADCELL R1 01   !Load cell 0x01's contents into register 1. Should be row 1, columnds 2 and 3 of the assembled hex code.
PRINT    R1      !Print contents of register 1
LOOP:    R2 RF F !Initialise loop that runs F times. Check if R2 = 0, if not, return to cell stored at RF
    PRINT    R1  !
    PRINT    R2
ENDLOOP  R2 RF
HALT             !Anything after an ! is explicitly a comment.